    "body": "This is almost certainly supposed to be comparing to the active entry (`displayedEntry` in the same algorithm steps). This is how it is implemented in both [gecko](https://searchfox.org/firefox-main/rev/93ba10a0a6e4ef012b47d033748f4b7bc317f541/docshell/base/nsDocShell.cpp#11383-11384) and [blink](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/loader/document_loader.cc;l=1802-1809).\n\ncc @noamr @farre ",
