    "created_at": "2026-09-09T10:39:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-09T10:39:41Z",
    "body": "> This is always false. I am unsure if it is okay to remove it, or if this is comparing against the wrong thing\n\nThis is technically not true, because `current session history entry` is mutated on the SHTQ, where as these steps are queued in a global task (so run on the event loop), so actually `current session history entry` can mutate in between all of the steps in 12.N-M, which is another reason why I think `displayedEntry` is the correct thing to compare against (as `active session history entry` only mutates on the event loop)",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
